 @Mull_YT  Despite your very interesting way of seeing this song, I have to tell you that I struggle with the same bs. Many tiems per week I seriously think about ending myself, but you even at my lowest points of life I couldn't do it, not only because there are people that geniuely care about me, but also because I saw the light. I saw the goodness in this world some times. They weren't as long and strong like this eternal darkness I seem to be, but I saw it,  I saw myself being surrounded by people that cared about me and I actually felt how i was almost shining of happiness and even youth. The thing is, I have almost accepeted my depresion I have accepeted that the only thing that doesn't make me go crazy is because I somehow "like" my sadness. With sad music, or just music that make me feel like that it actually makes me happier than "Happy songs". I redecorated my depresion and now it still fucked but it doesn't take things too seriously.

Thats just my point of view of my own life right now in this moment. Because probably tomorrow im going to go crazy again for the same old shit things as always.. im terrified about the future, but what else we can do.

Hope you find peace, and im glad that i was reminded that Im not the only think with sick thoughts, which arent actually sick, its just that they are not spoken until is written in a piece of paper.
